<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:table="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:table:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text">
<office:font-face-decls><style:font-face style:name="F" svg:font-family="'Noto Serif CJK SC'" xmlns:svg="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:svg-compatible:1.0"/></office:font-face-decls>
<office:styles><style:default-style style:family="paragraph"><style:text-properties style:font-name="F" style:font-name-asian="F" fo:font-size="11pt" style:font-size-asian="11pt"/></style:default-style></office:styles>
<office:automatic-styles>
<style:style style:name="Sect2" style:family="section"><style:section-properties><style:columns fo:column-count="2" fo:column-gap="1cm"/></style:section-properties></style:style>
<style:style style:name="Brk" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:break-before="column"/></style:style>
</office:automatic-styles>
<office:body><office:text><text:h text:outline-level="1">衡台知识库季度运营报告</text:h><text:p>本报告汇总了第三季度知识库的使用情况，包括文档入库数量、检索命中率以及用户满意度等核心指标。</text:p><text:p>在权限控制方面，系统采用预过滤策略，确保用户只能检索到其有权访问的文档片段。</text:p><text:p>下季度计划引入增量索引与自动过期机制，以降低重建索引带来的资源开销。</text:p><table:table table:name="T1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>部门</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>文档数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>检索次数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>命中率</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>财务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>1204</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>35210</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>92.4%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>法务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>876</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12045</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>88.1%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>研发中心</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>5310</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>98022</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>95.7%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:section text:style-name="Sect2" text:name="S2"><text:p>左栏：多栏排版是政府公文和期刊论文中常见的版式，解析器需要按阅读顺序输出文字，而不是按行横向拼接两栏内容。</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Brk">右栏：如果解析器把左右两栏的同一行拼在一起，切片后的语义会被破坏，从而直接影响向量检索的召回质量。</text:p></text:section><text:h text:outline-level="1">衡台知识库季度运营报告</text:h><text:p>本报告汇总了第三季度知识库的使用情况，包括文档入库数量、检索命中率以及用户满意度等核心指标。</text:p><text:p>在权限控制方面，系统采用预过滤策略，确保用户只能检索到其有权访问的文档片段。</text:p><text:p>下季度计划引入增量索引与自动过期机制，以降低重建索引带来的资源开销。</text:p><table:table table:name="T1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>部门</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>文档数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>检索次数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>命中率</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>财务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>1204</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>35210</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>92.4%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>法务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>876</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12045</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>88.1%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>研发中心</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>5310</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>98022</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>95.7%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:section text:style-name="Sect2" text:name="S2"><text:p>左栏：多栏排版是政府公文和期刊论文中常见的版式，解析器需要按阅读顺序输出文字，而不是按行横向拼接两栏内容。</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Brk">右栏：如果解析器把左右两栏的同一行拼在一起，切片后的语义会被破坏，从而直接影响向量检索的召回质量。</text:p></text:section><text:h text:outline-level="1">衡台知识库季度运营报告</text:h><text:p>本报告汇总了第三季度知识库的使用情况，包括文档入库数量、检索命中率以及用户满意度等核心指标。</text:p><text:p>在权限控制方面，系统采用预过滤策略，确保用户只能检索到其有权访问的文档片段。</text:p><text:p>下季度计划引入增量索引与自动过期机制，以降低重建索引带来的资源开销。</text:p><table:table table:name="T1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>部门</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>文档数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>检索次数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>命中率</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>财务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>1204</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>35210</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>92.4%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>法务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>876</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12045</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>88.1%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>研发中心</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>5310</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>98022</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>95.7%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:section text:style-name="Sect2" text:name="S2"><text:p>左栏：多栏排版是政府公文和期刊论文中常见的版式，解析器需要按阅读顺序输出文字，而不是按行横向拼接两栏内容。</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Brk">右栏：如果解析器把左右两栏的同一行拼在一起，切片后的语义会被破坏，从而直接影响向量检索的召回质量。</text:p></text:section><text:h text:outline-level="1">衡台知识库季度运营报告</text:h><text:p>本报告汇总了第三季度知识库的使用情况，包括文档入库数量、检索命中率以及用户满意度等核心指标。</text:p><text:p>在权限控制方面，系统采用预过滤策略，确保用户只能检索到其有权访问的文档片段。</text:p><text:p>下季度计划引入增量索引与自动过期机制，以降低重建索引带来的资源开销。</text:p><table:table table:name="T1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>部门</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>文档数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>检索次数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>命中率</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>财务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>1204</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>35210</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>92.4%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>法务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>876</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12045</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>88.1%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>研发中心</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>5310</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>98022</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>95.7%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:section text:style-name="Sect2" text:name="S2"><text:p>左栏：多栏排版是政府公文和期刊论文中常见的版式，解析器需要按阅读顺序输出文字，而不是按行横向拼接两栏内容。</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Brk">右栏：如果解析器把左右两栏的同一行拼在一起，切片后的语义会被破坏，从而直接影响向量检索的召回质量。</text:p></text:section><text:h text:outline-level="1">衡台知识库季度运营报告</text:h><text:p>本报告汇总了第三季度知识库的使用情况，包括文档入库数量、检索命中率以及用户满意度等核心指标。</text:p><text:p>在权限控制方面，系统采用预过滤策略，确保用户只能检索到其有权访问的文档片段。</text:p><text:p>下季度计划引入增量索引与自动过期机制，以降低重建索引带来的资源开销。</text:p><table:table table:name="T1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>部门</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>文档数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>检索次数</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>命中率</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>财务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>1204</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>35210</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>92.4%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>法务部</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>876</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12045</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>88.1%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>研发中心</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>5310</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>98022</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>95.7%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row